[Desktop Entry]
# Hearth OS on Anatase (test): Send logs as an app in Plasma's menu (Mantel had it in its own menus).
Name=Send logs
GenericName=Send logs to Hearth
Comment=Send this PC's logs so a problem can be looked at (you get a code to pass on)
Exec=sh -c "/usr/bin/hearth-send-logs; echo; echo 'Press Enter to close'; read x"
Terminal=true
Icon=hearth-settings
Type=Application
Categories=System;Utility;
Keywords=logs;report;bug;problem;support;send;
